# Staging area for `wiki/capture` skill drafts.
# Files here are NOT canonical wiki — they are pending Finn-approval.
# Skill workflow:
#   1. Hermes drafts → staging/<original-target-folder>/<slug>.md
#   2. Telegram preview surfaces
#   3. On YES → file moves out of staging into target folder + git commit + push
#   4. On NO  → file deleted from staging
# Periodically inspect this tree. If > 20 stragglers live here, the approval
# loop is being neglected — guard G6 flags this on every draft.
